      "intend:description": "A microservice processing OSEF Zones data from LiDAR sensors. The processed data includes zone information such as zones definitions and bindings. The service reads a KAFKA stream of OSEF data from LiDAR sensors and produces a KAFKA stream of OSEF Zones data.",
      "intend:name": "crosswalk-safety-alert",
